MODIFICATIONS MADE IN THIS FORK
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Per Apache 2.0 Section 4(b), the following files carry modifications or
are newly added relative to the upstream AgeBand project.

ADDED
  src/bracket_eval/pipeline.py       Synchronous deterministic pipeline
                                     driver for offline evaluation.
  src/bracket_eval/metrics.py        Confusion matrix, Expected/Maximum
                                     Calibration Error, Brier score,
                                     reliability binning.
  src/bracket_eval/calibration.py    Asymmetric safety cost function and
                                     policy-threshold grid search.
  src/bracket_eval/datasets.py       Held-out and Blog Authorship Corpus
                                     loaders.
  src/signal_extraction/hinglish.py  Code-mixed Hindi-English cue lexicon
                                     and language detection.
  scripts/run_eval.py                Evaluation CLI.
  scripts/_build_holdout.py          Held-out dataset builder.
  data/holdout_en.jsonl              Held-out English transcripts.
  data/holdout_hinglish.jsonl        Held-out Hinglish transcripts.
  data/adversarial.jsonl             Evasion suite.
  tests/unit/bracket_eval/           40 tests covering the above.
  docs/NOVELTIES.md                  What this fork adds, and why.
  RUN_AND_DEPLOY.md                  Run and deployment guide.

MODIFIED
  src/signal_extraction/keyword_extractor.py
      Routes code-mixed Hindi-English turns to the Hinglish lexicon
      before the English-abstention gate. English path unchanged.
  src/signal_extraction/lexicon.py
      assign_weight_any() and band_hint_any() now resolve Hinglish
      subtypes before falling back to the English default.
  pyproject.toml
      Added pytest pythonpath = ["."] so bare `pytest` works.
  scripts/notebook_server_utils.py
      Fixed _is_colab(): importlib.util.find_spec() RAISES
      ModuleNotFoundError when the PARENT package is absent rather
      than returning None. On any machine without the `google`
      namespace package installed, environment detection crashed
      instead of reporting "not Colab", breaking the notebook path.
      Now catches that and returns False.
  tests/unit/test_notebook_server_utils.py
      Same guard applied in
      test_is_colab_returns_false_when_google_colab_absent.
  README.md
      Rewritten for this fork. Original preserved at
      docs/UPSTREAM_README.md.

UNCHANGED
  The pipeline architecture, planner-supervisor loop, deterministic
  guard shell, confidence formula, policy table, orchestration,
  FastAPI service, React UI, Docker image and Helm chart are
  Asish Bose's design and are used as-is.
